	TAD NSCODE	/NEW SAMPLING CODE ?
	SNA CLA
	JMP TAL16	/NO, GO ON.

	TAD TAL15M	/IS OUR MESSAGE BUSY ?
	SZA CLA
	JMP TAL16	/YES, GO ON
